Claim_Concrete_Test
├── when the account has nothing to claim
│   └── it should revert
└── when the account has a claimable balance
    ├── when the transfer to the account fails
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the transfer succeeds
        ├── it should pay the account, whoever calls
        ├── it should clear the account's balance and lower the total claimable
        └── it should emit {Claimed}
